cab","id":"cet6-vocab_222","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"plausible","a":"adj. 貌似合理的；花言巧语的","n":"a plausible explanation 看似合理的解释","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_223","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"prevalent","a":"adj. 普遍的；流行的","n":"a prevalent view 普遍观点","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_224","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"profound","a":"adj. 深刻的；深奥的；渊博的","n":"a profound impact 深远影响","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_225","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"prominent","a":"adj. 突出的；著名的；显眼的","n":"a prominent scholar 著名学者","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_226","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"random","a":"adj. 随机的；任意的","n":"a random sample 随机样本","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_227","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"rigorous","a":"adj. 严格的；严谨的；严酷的","n":"rigorous training 严格训练","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_228","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"robust","a":"adj. 强健的；稳健的；坚固的","n":"a robust economy 稳健的经济","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_229","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"simultaneous","a":"adj. 同时发生的","n":"simultaneous translation 同声传译","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_230","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"spontaneous","a":"adj. 自发的；自然的；一时冲动的","n":"a spontaneous decision 一时冲动的决定","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_231","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"substantial","a":"adj. 大量的；实质的；坚固的","n":"a substantial increase 大幅增长","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_232","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"高频形容词","q":"versatile","a":"adj. 多才多艺的；多用途的","n":"a versatile tool 多功能工具","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_233","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"nevertheless","a":"adv. 然而；不过（= nonetheless）","n":"The risk is real; nevertheless, we should proceed. 风险真实存在，不过我们仍应推进。","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_234","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"furthermore","a":"adv. 此外；而且（= moreover）","n":"Furthermore, the cost is falling. 此外，成本正在下降。","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_235","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"consequently","a":"adv. 因此；结果","n":"Consequently, demand dropped. 因此需求下降。","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_236","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"whereas","a":"conj. 然而；鉴于（用于对比）","n":"Urban areas thrive, whereas rural ones lag behind. 城市繁荣，而农村落后。","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_237","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"provided that","a":"conj. 假如；只要（= providing）","n":"We will proceed provided that funding is secured. 只要资金到位我们就推进。","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_238","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"in terms of","a":"prep. 就…而言；在…方面","n":"In terms of cost, this plan wins. 就成本而言这个方案更优。","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_239","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"by virtue of","a":"prep. 由于；凭借","n":"He succeeded by virtue of hard work. 他凭借努力取得成功。","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_240","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"in the wake of","a":"prep. 随…之后；作为…的结果","n":"in the wake of the pandemic 疫情之后","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_241","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"on the grounds that","a":"conj. 基于…的理由；因为","n":"refuse on the grounds that it is unsafe 以不安全为由拒绝","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_242","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"for the sake of","a":"prep. 为了…起见","n":"for the sake of simplicity 为简洁起见","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_243","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"in light of","a":"prep. 鉴于；考虑到","n":"In light of new evidence 鉴于新证据","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_244","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"with regard to","a":"prep. 关于；至于","n":"questions with regard to policy 有关政策的问题","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_245","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"to some extent","a":"adv. 在某种程度上","n":"True to some extent 在某种程度上正确","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_246","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"in essence","a":"adv. 本质上；大体上","n":"In essence, it is a trade-off. 本质上这是一种取舍。","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_247","k":["en-vocab"]},{"t":"term","c":"写作逻辑","q":"by and large","a":"adv. 总的来说；大体上","n":"By and large, the reform worked. 总的来说改革奏效了。","deck":"cet6-vocab","id":"cet6-vocab_248","k":["en-vocab"]}]